		{"id":"macro-1","type":"text","text":"## LEFT ZONE: THE FRONT OFFICE (Act 1-11)\n### FEATURE-E6-01 & 02: Transaction Genesis & Window Management\n* Establishing order from market chaos via systematic scheduling, capital checks, and baseline window reservation constraints.","x":-600,"y":-300,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"downward-spiral","type":"text","text":"## THE DOWNWARD LOOP: THE REJECTION SPIRAL\n### US-E6-104 ➔ US-E6-105: Human / User Failures\n* **The Fall:** Flawed trades undergo mandatory structural correction.\n* **The Echo:** `(🔗 Echoes Front Office Input Errors)`\n* Returning flawed metrics to baseline author states.","x":-600,"y":-20,"width":400,"height":360},
		{"id":"hinge-node","type":"text","text":"# ⬇ THE CENTRAL HINGE PIN (Genesis 12 Anchor) ⬇\n## FEATURE-E6-05: POST-TRADE COMPLIANCE REPORTING\n* **The Master Resolution Hook:** Out of trade volatility, compliance reconciliation platforms generate authoritative regulatory records.\n* **Fulfillment:** Transmitting absolute transparency logs to downstream regulatory nodes.","x":-150,"y":280,"width":800,"height":220},
